{"id":"84c39ea3efb71898","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-hif-random-equivalence.md","title":"HIF 度上的 ML 与 Kurtz 随机性等价","display":"thm-hif-random-equivalence — HIF 度上的 ML 与 Kurtz 随机性等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-hif-random-equivalence","aliases":["20-thm-hif-random-equivalence"],"display":"thm-hif-random-equivalence — HIF 度上的 ML 与 Kurtz 随机性等价","chapter":"11","section":"11.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 11.4.4","source_printed_pages":[194],"source_pdf_pages":[225],"depends_on":["[[20-df-kurtz-random]]","[[20-df-random]]","[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[20-df-ml-test]]","[[20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence]]","[[20-thm-null-class-no-random]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-hif-random-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-hif-random-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hif-random-equivalence — HIF 度上的 ML 与 Kurtz 随机性等价"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 11.4.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>194</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>225</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"323381492f97cb49\" href=\"?note=323381492f97cb49\" title=\"20-df-kurtz-random\">20-df-kurtz-random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"238731f42b452fa7\" href=\"?note=238731f42b452fa7\" title=\"20-df-random\">20-df-random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0f911a6b1b63f977\" href=\"?note=0f911a6b1b63f977\" title=\"20-df-ml-test\">20-df-ml-test</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"12b65ff45a1e7d01\" href=\"?note=12b65ff45a1e7d01\" title=\"20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence\">20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"58aed4b78aae5919\" href=\"?note=58aed4b78aae5919\" title=\"20-thm-null-class-no-random\">20-thm-null-class-no-random</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(X))\">\\(\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(X))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"323381492f97cb49\" href=\"?note=323381492f97cb49\" title=\"20-df-kurtz-random\">20-df-kurtz-random</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"238731f42b452fa7\" href=\"?note=238731f42b452fa7\" title=\"20-df-random\">20-df-random</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0f911a6b1b63f977\" href=\"?note=0f911a6b1b63f977\" title=\"20-df-ml-test\">20-df-ml-test</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"12b65ff45a1e7d01\" href=\"?note=12b65ff45a1e7d01\" title=\"20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence\">20-thm-kurtz-test-equivalence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"58aed4b78aae5919\" href=\"?note=58aed4b78aae5919\" title=\"20-thm-null-class-no-random\">20-thm-null-class-no-random</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-random-equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{KurtzRandom}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hif-random-equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{KurtzRandom}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正向由零测度有效闭类不含随机成员。反向，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 失败某个 ML 检验 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(n)\">\\(t(n)\\)</span> 为其前缀首次出现在第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层开覆盖枚举的阶段；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 全且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 可计算。HIF 给普通可计算逐点时间界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(n)\">\\(b(n)\\)</span>（有限修补允许）。截取到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b(n)\">\\(b(n)\\)</span> 的有限柱并 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_n\">\\(V_n\\)</span> clopen 且含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，测度仍至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-n}\">\\(2^{-n}\\)</span>。交 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\bigcap_nV_n\">\\(C=\\bigcap_nV_n\\)</span> 是含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的零测度有效闭类，违背 KurtzRandom。若直接需要严格 Kurtz 测度界，可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{n+1}\">\\(V_{n+1}\\)</span>，其界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-(n+1)}&lt;2^{-n}\">\\(2^{-(n+1)}&lt;2^{-n}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.4.4；印刷页 194；PDF 第 225 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-kurtz-random","status":"resolved","id":"323381492f97cb49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location